  slug="dialog-element"
  title="The HTML dialog element: real modals without a library"
  description="The HTML dialog element gives you a true modal - top layer, inert page, backdrop and Esc handling - from plain markup. Here is showModal vs show, form method=dialog, returnValue, the closedby attribute and the one habit to avoid."
  cat="html"
